Contributions Directory
-----------------------



Overview
--------
All programs which in someway interact with the TetriNET server are
put under this directory. 
This file contains brief descriptions of what each program does, and
who sent it in. If you want to provide a fuller description, then please
do email me it :)



Programs
--------

* contrib/query 	(dds - 13/10/98)
	This program connects to the query port of TetriNET servers
	(introduced in Build 11 onwards), and allows a person to
	query various stats of people logged in, and to be able to
	kick any of those people off.


* contrib/systemd 	(agcorreatech - 2026)
	systemd unit file and install script to run tetrinetx as a Linux
	service (systemctl start/stop/restart/status tetrinetx). See
	contrib/systemd/README.md for details.


Historical Reference
---------------------

* contrib/OLD.HISTORY, contrib/OLD.WISHLIST 	(moved here - 2026)
	These are the original build-by-build changelog (1998-1999) and
	the original feature wishlist from the very first tetrinetx author.
	They are kept here purely as historical reference (e.g. to see when
	and why a given behaviour was first introduced, or what was once
	requested but never built). They are NOT maintained anymore and do
	NOT reflect the current state of the project -- see CHANGELOG.md in
	the repository root for the current, maintained changelog.


